156
00:07:54,981 --> 00:07:59,070
Suzuki, what day is it tomorrow?

157
00:07:59,094 --> 00:08:03,148
Tomorrow is Saturday.

158
00:08:03,171 --> 00:08:06,374
Oh, Saturday?

159
00:08:06,398 --> 00:08:10,249
What time does the department store open?

160
00:08:10,272 --> 00:08:15,272
The department store opens at 10 AM.

161
00:08:15,295 --> 00:08:18,462
And it’s open until 8 PM.

162
00:08:18,485 --> 00:08:21,365
Starting at 10 AM, got it.

163
00:08:21,389 --> 00:08:26,271
Are there any bag shops inside the department store?

164
00:08:26,294 --> 00:08:32,752
Yes, there are plenty of bag shops on the second floor.

165
00:08:32,776 --> 00:08:37,176
There are also clothing and shoe stores.

166
00:08:37,199 --> 00:08:39,418
Sounds great!

167
00:08:39,441 --> 00:08:44,487
Shall we go to the department store tomorrow morning?

168
00:08:44,511 --> 00:08:46,522
Sounds great!

169
00:08:46,545 --> 00:08:49,278
Let’s go together!

170
00:08:49,301 --> 00:08:51,834
What time should we meet?

171
00:08:51,857 --> 00:08:57,116
Let’s meet at the station at 9:50 AM.

172
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:59,873
It's 9:50.

173
00:08:59,896 --> 00:09:03,429
Why are we going to the department store?

174
00:09:03,452 --> 00:09:06,452
Let's take the bus.

175
00:09:06,475 --> 00:09:10,114
The bus stop is in front of the station.

176
00:09:10,137 --> 00:09:12,108
Got it.

177
00:09:12,132 --> 00:09:17,132
Where did you go shopping yesterday, UI?

178
00:09:17,155 --> 00:09:23,189
I bought vegetables and fruits at the supermarket yesterday.

179
00:09:23,213 --> 00:09:27,379
What did you buy yesterday, Suzuki?

180
00:09:27,402 --> 00:09:31,890
I didn’t buy anything yesterday.

181
00:09:31,913 --> 00:09:34,317
I see.

182
00:09:34,341 --> 00:09:38,875
Well then, let’s buy a lot tomorrow!

183
00:09:38,898 --> 00:09:40,737
Yes, I am.

184
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:45,194
Are we going shopping for just one hour tomorrow?

185
00:09:45,217 --> 00:09:50,383
No, let’s shop for about three hours.

186
00:09:50,406 --> 00:09:52,659
Three hours?

187
00:09:52,683 --> 00:09:55,883
That’s a lot of walking!

188
00:09:55,906 --> 00:09:59,473
Yeah, let’s walk.

189
00:09:59,496 --> 00:10:02,496
Scene 6: Studying and Tests / Let’s Talk About Studying and the Test

190
00:10:02,496 --> 00:10:07,948
Suzuki, did you study last night?

191
00:10:07,972 --> 00:10:14,984
Yes, I studied Japanese for two hours last night.

192
00:10:15,007 --> 00:10:18,974
How many hours did you study, Tanaka?

193
00:10:18,997 --> 00:10:25,230
I didn’t study at all last night.

194
00:10:25,253 --> 00:10:27,943
Oh, really?

195
00:10:27,966 --> 00:10:31,533
How was yesterday’s test?

196
00:10:31,556 --> 00:10:35,156
The test started at 10.

197
00:10:35,179 --> 00:10:40,413
Was there a clock in the test room?

198
00:10:40,436 --> 00:10:46,070
No, there wasn’t a clock in the room.

199
00:10:46,093 --> 00:10:50,026
I see. That must have been inconvenient.

200
00:10:50,049 --> 00:10:54,735
Why don’t we study at the library this afternoon?

201
00:10:54,759 --> 00:10:57,492
This afternoon?

202
00:10:57,515 --> 00:11:01,682
I’ll be at the library from 1 to 4.

203
00:11:01,705 --> 00:11:04,518
Let’s study together!

204
00:11:04,541 --> 00:11:08,954
Are there dictionaries in the library?

205
00:11:08,977 --> 00:11:15,822
Yes, there are plenty of Japanese dictionaries on the desks.

206
00:11:15,846 --> 00:11:18,180
Are there computers too?

207
00:11:18,203 --> 00:11:22,536
Yes, there are five computers as well.

208
00:11:22,559 --> 00:11:24,611
Sounds great!

209
00:11:24,635 --> 00:11:27,677
How are you getting to the library?

210
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:30,519
I’ll go by bike.

211
00:11:30,542 --> 00:11:34,009
How are you getting there, Suzuki?

212
00:11:34,032 --> 00:11:38,565
I’ll go by car with a friend.

213
00:11:38,588 --> 00:11:40,722
Got it.

214
00:11:40,745 --> 00:11:45,011
Alright, let’s meet at the library at 1.

215
00:11:45,034 --> 00:11:48,077
Sure, see you later!

216
00:11:48,101 --> 00:11:51,101
Scene 7: Wrapping Up Work and Weekend Plans / Let’s Talk About Work Hours and the Weekend

217
00:11:51,101 --> 00:11:54,793
It’s Friday night, Suzuki.

218
00:11:54,817 --> 00:11:58,817
What time do you finish work today?

219
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:02,378
I’ll finish at 6 today.

220
00:12:02,401 --> 00:12:06,835
What time do you finish work, Tanaka?

221
00:12:06,858 --> 00:12:11,338
I’ll work until 5:30.

222
00:12:11,362 --> 00:12:14,928
You’ll finish at 5:30, right?

223
00:12:14,951 --> 00:12:16,487
Yes, I am.

224
00:12:16,511 --> 00:12:21,160
I worked a lot every day this week.

225
00:12:21,183 --> 00:12:23,350
I see.

226
00:12:23,373 --> 00:12:25,606
You must be tired. Good work!

227
00:12:25,629 --> 00:12:30,196
What are your plans for Saturday and Sunday?

228
00:12:30,219 --> 00:12:34,253
I’ll wake up at 9 on Saturday morning.

229
00:12:34,276 --> 00:12:38,154
After that, I'm going to the park with my friends.

230
00:12:38,177 --> 00:12:41,178
What will you do at the park?

231
00:12:41,202 --> 00:12:44,180
We'll play tennis at the park.

232
00:12:44,203 --> 00:12:48,536
Suzuki, do you play tennis on weekends?

233
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:53,326
No, I don't play tennis at all.

234
00:12:53,349 --> 00:12:56,949
I'm watching a movie on Sunday.

235
00:12:56,972 --> 00:12:59,805
Where are you watching the movie?

236
00:12:59,828 --> 00:13:03,462
I'll watch it at a movie theater in Shibuya.

237
00:13:03,485 --> 00:13:08,652
Tanaka, would you like to watch a movie together this Saturday night?

238
00:13:08,675 --> 00:13:11,209
Saturday night?

239
00:13:11,232 --> 00:13:13,119
Sounds great!

240
00:13:13,142 --> 00:13:15,549
What time is the movie?

241
00:13:15,572 --> 00:13:19,041
It's the 7 PM movie.

242
00:13:19,065 --> 00:13:21,702
It runs from 7 to 9 PM.

243
00:13:21,725 --> 00:13:23,692
Got it.

244
00:13:23,715 --> 00:13:29,315
Then let's meet in front of the theater at 6:30.

245
00:13:29,338 --> 00:13:30,988
Yes, I am.

246
00:13:31,012 --> 00:13:33,179
Are you going by train?

247
00:13:33,202 --> 00:13:34,735
Yes, I am.

248
00:13:34,758 --> 00:13:36,691
I'll take the subway.

249
00:13:36,714 --> 00:13:38,997
Got it.

250
00:13:39,020 --> 00:13:41,233
I'm looking forward to it!

251
00:13:41,257 --> 00:13:44,257
