252
00:13:44,257 --> 00:13:50,350
Suzuki, are you going to the supermarket this evening?

253
00:13:50,373 --> 00:13:54,459
Yes, I'm heading to the supermarket at 5 PM.

254
00:13:54,483 --> 00:13:57,250
Tanaka, are you going too?

255
00:13:57,273 --> 00:14:00,888
Yes, I'll go at 5 PM as well.

256
00:14:00,912 --> 00:14:03,482
Shall we go together?

257
00:14:03,506 --> 00:14:05,340
Sounds great!

258
00:14:05,363 --> 00:14:07,736
Let’s go together!

259
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:10,846
What are you buying at the supermarket?

260
00:14:10,869 --> 00:14:13,902
