263
00:14:20,705 --> 00:14:25,582
The meat section is near the entrance.

264
00:14:25,605 --> 00:14:29,018
The fish section is at the back.

265
00:14:29,042 --> 00:14:30,893
Got it.

266
00:14:30,916 --> 00:14:33,883
Do they have a lot of vegetables?

267
00:14:33,906 --> 00:14:37,676
Yes, they have plenty of vegetables too.

268
00:14:37,700 --> 00:14:40,733
I bought tomatoes yesterday.

269
00:14:40,756 --> 00:14:43,454
How much were the tomatoes?

270
00:14:43,477 --> 00:14:47,077
They were 100 yen each.

271
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:49,634
100 yen each?

272
00:14:49,657 --> 00:14:51,665
Let's buy some today too.

273
00:14:51,688 --> 00:14:56,463
Where are you going after shopping?

274
00:14:56,486 --> 00:15:01,519
Why don't you come to my place after shopping?

275
00:15:01,542 --> 00:15:03,742
Your place, Tanaka?

276
00:15:03,765 --> 00:15:05,462
Is that okay?

